[[Open This|MSE: What you’ll bring]]

---

Ability to lead technical, customer-facing teams and support the growth of Support Engineers at different levels through feedback, mentoring, and growth opportunities.

Ability to create and implement processes and procedures that improve team efficiency.

Ability to provide technical customer support and manage the full support lifecycle, from understanding customer needs and initial engagement through resolution, in collaboration with development.

Analytical and problem-solving skills to troubleshoot complex technical issues and the ability to grow your team’s problem-solving skills.

Understanding of Linux System Administration and web application development concepts (with MVC frameworks such as Ruby on Rails, Python, Django, PHP, or Laravel).
